      "why": "The two lists overlap: agents is the subset running one, carrying the same fields plus the counter. Reading the world from that subset would drop every pane without an agent, which is most of them, and would look like a session that lost its panes rather than like a translation bug.",
      "given": {
        "snapshot": {
          "agents": [
            {
              "agent": "probe",
              "agent_status": "working",
              "cwd": "/private/tmp",
              "focused": true,
              "foreground_cwd": "/private/tmp",
              "pane_id": "w1:p1",
              "revision": 0,
              "state_change_seq": 5,
              "tab_id": "w1:t1",
              "terminal_id": "term_658cc79740b221",
